+| D-020 | 2026-10-01 | Cursor sessions use `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/` beside Claude Code. `.claude/` remains the policy source. Claude Code aliases in `docs/spec/06-MODEL-PLAN.md` are not Cursor picker values. The session records the model name it actually shows. A missing alias does not fail the milestone. | `AGENTS.md` cited this decision before the row existed. The M0A intent review in this session ran as Grok 4.7. | `AGENTS.md`; accepted INT-00; `docs/spec/06-MODEL-PLAN.md` §8 | decided |
